{"reviews":[{"id":"B00GGZLP16-0","r":5.0,"t":"When I shopped here the price was so much better!!","x":"This product is what the vet ordered.  When I shopped here the price was so much better!!!  Thanks and I will be back at this site  often!","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-1","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Need for my older dog, cheaper then the vet","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-2","r":1.0,"t":"BURNED MY EYES AND NO RESPONSE FROM THEIR CUSTOMER SERVICE.","x":"Burns my eyes.  Having to pay RETURN POSTAGE.  Save yourself some time, burning eyes and don't put yourself of having to spend money to return defective product.  I use ten bottles of MURINE LIQUID TEARS every month and have NEVER EXPERIENCED BURING EYES WITH MURINE.  Their Customer Service  Department is nonexistent.  They  NEVER responded to my email letting them know that there is a problem with their product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-3","r":5.0,"t":"She has allergies and about every 3 days I put a little dab of this gel in her eyes and they stay nice and moist for the","x":"This is the ONLY stuff that has helped my Yorkie's eyes. She has allergies and about every 3 days I put a little dab of this gel in her eyes and they stay nice and moist for the 3 days. Before many days she couldn't even open one of her eyes. Believe me, I tried lots of different ointments and drops. This is by far the best and was recommended by my sister-in-law vet!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great Price","x":"Same stuff the vet sold me, at 1/3 the price. My dog is likely going to need this for the rest of his life. If you're dealing with a temporary situation, you probably don't want 3 tubes. It goes a long way.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-5","r":5.0,"t":"My older shih-tzu suffers from dry eyes, and will ...","x":"My older shih-tzu suffers from dry eyes, and will be on this stuff the rest of his days.  It really helps.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-6","r":5.0,"t":"... who has dry eyes and they seem to work better than anything on the market","x":"I use these for my Pug who has dry eyes and they seem to work better than anything on the market.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-7","r":5.0,"t":"Attention dry eye sufferes..Best pm ointment.","x":"If you have severe dry eyes, this is the best pm ointment. I have used every name brand as well as Target and Walmart brand. This ointment stays &#34;put&#34; while you sleep, is soothing and you don't have to pry your eye lids open in the am.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-8","r":5.0,"t":"Good for cats too!","x":"We use this on our cat that has bilateral eyelid agenesis. It helps to keep his eyelids moist and less agitated.  We like the ointment because it seems to provide longer relief than regular drops.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-9","r":5.0,"t":"Lifesaver","x":"These have been a lifesaver for my Boston with allergies.  He constantly has dry, goopy, red eyes.  The vet recommended gel or ointment for his eyes and these help hom so much.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-10","r":4.0,"t":"not quite as good as the normal brands but my eyes are not ...","x":"not quite as good as the normal brands but my eyes are not as bad as they used to be so find this is working ok. Would not recommend this if you have extreme dry eye.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great product and fantastic price.","x":"Use it for my pekingese dogs at night.  Works well and great price.  My vet charges more than double.  Don't feel so bad if I miss and have to reapply.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-12","r":5.0,"t":"Low tech and very effective","x":"I reorder all the time.  Good for night time use for dry eyes.  Recommended by doctor after eye surgery.  Amazon has best price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-13","r":4.0,"t":"Recommend!","x":"My lab doesn't produce tears anymore due to allergies. These really help to keep his eyes lubricated. Thank you!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2015"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great buy!!","x":"I purchased this for my precious little dog's eyes. The same product at the vet is much more expensive.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great !","x":"I love this eye ointment but not the increase in price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2015"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-16","r":5.0,"t":"Great price! Need product for my pug's eye condition","x":"Great price!  Need product for my pug's eye condition.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-17","r":4.0,"t":"Very Good and Affordable","x":"Compared to most of the dry eye ointments out there, this is very reasonably priced and contains the same ingredients as those other brands.  It is a little thick in consistency, but that's okay, since I use it only at nighttime.  Do NOT try to use it during the day, as it will blur your vision and it takes a while to get it out of your eyes.  An excellent value, as these eye products are usually pretty pricey.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-18","r":3.0,"t":"The ointment is thick and really nice, but its difficult to squeeze out and then ...","x":"The ointment is thick and really nice, but its difficult to squeeze out and then you realize it keeps coming out of the tube even after you are done with it. It wastes so much product. I use it in my two yorkies eyes and one tube only lasted 7 days.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-19","r":5.0,"t":"Same ingredeints as eye lubricant Vet sells, but cost a lot less!","x":"Great eye lubricant for my dogs. I first bought some from Vet when my dog scratched her eye and got a corneal ulcer. That tube was $9, this has the same ingredients but a lot less, more affordable.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-20","r":5.0,"t":"Effective and dirt cheap","x":"Very effective for my senior cocker spaniel with permanent dry eye condition. Have to reapply liberally several times a day, but it's way cheaper than using OptiImmune all the time.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-21","r":5.0,"t":"Better than Refresh PM.","x":"Lower price and works very well but I still have to take Thera Tears Nutrition Supplement also to actually feel the difference with my extremely dry eyes due to Lasik 2 years ago.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love this product for my my little yorkie/poo's dry eye","x":"Love this product for my my little yorkie/poo's dry eye. It works better than puralube. I would recommend this product to anyone with a pet with eye problems especially dry eye.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-23","r":5.0,"t":"Good for dry eyes.","x":"My husband uses these drops when his eyes get dry--working outside, sometimes after driving. They moisten his eyes and soothe them.  He's very pleased with these drops.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B00GGZLP16-24","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent price","x":"Great price.  All though this may seem like a veterinary item only based on the name of the supplier, it is made for humans.  I guess pets can use this too.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the price, noting it is much cheaper than what the vet charges.","cites":[1,2,5,12,13,15]},{"text":"Many customers use the product for their pets' dry eyes and allergies and report it helps keep eyes moist and comfortable.","cites":[4,6,7,9,10,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers find it effective for nighttime dry eye relief and long-lasting lubrication.","cites":[8,9,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers note it is not as good as name brands or may not suit extreme dry eye.","cites":[11]},{"text":"One reviewer reports burning eyes and poor customer service with return postage costs.","cites":[3]}]},"qa":[]}